            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontsize='11'>A vendor might influence the metrics &gt; 1 time due to different integrations. Therefore, for the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># Physical Vendors </run>
                <run fontsize='11'>&amp; </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'># Platform Vendors</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>, we count the combinations of </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>vendor identifier + POS start date</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>.  </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>For example: </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='11'><![CDATA[<Sheet name="[POS B&A] Vendor Count Explained" maxwidth="500" maxheight="500" filter="]]></run>
                <run>[[Info Tooltip] Physical Vendor Identification Not Null], [[Info Tooltip] Physical Vendor Identification]</run>
                <run fontsize='11'>&quot;&gt;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#b4b4b4' italic='true'>**  Loading time ~10 seconds. If the example visualisation is empty, we don&apos;t have a vendor with &gt; 1 integration in the last 12 m</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='mark-labels-cull' value='true' />
                <format attr='mark-labels-show' value='false' />
